   "ruling": "Ruling: ambiguity; amb.2025.separated_spouses_box (owner's decision, 2026-10-26). The model compares the restatement with the printed box wording, which has no EIC conditions. The only instructions for the box are the earned income credit's: i1040gi p. 41, Step 3, question 6, \"No. Check the box in the Dependents section that discusses the special rule for separated spouses on page 1 of Form 1040 or 1040-SR\", and p. 44, Special rule for separated spouses, \"If you meet these requirements, make sure you check the box in the Dependents section\". The register records both readings (checked only under the EIC special rule, or whenever the printed condition holds) and the first is chosen; the rendered English states the chosen reading (eic.separated_box) accurately. (Carried over in the refresh round: the same objection, and the screens it relies on are unchanged.)",
